 now as soon as possible so we can ensure this appointment time can be offer
 ed to other patients.\n\n\n\nYou are scheduled to receive the Pfizer vaccin
 e. Your second dose appointment will be automatically scheduled at the time
  of first dose administration. Ochsner will notify you of the exact date an
 d time of their second dose appointment via text and email within 24 hours 
 of first dose administration.\n\n\n\nBelow are special instructions for you
 r appointment\, please:\n\n•Arrive at your scheduled time. \n\n•Ensure that
  you have a valid ID. \n\n•Wear clothing that will allow our staff to acces
 s your upper arm to administer the shot. \n\n•Be prepared to wait 15 minute
 s for observation following your vaccination.\n\nPlease check in at the Fro
 nt of the Hospital / Lobby\, not the OB clinic.\n\n
